* Test program for DDM field-name completion (feature 16, T7, Story 3, AC1/AC2)
DEFINE DATA
LOCAL
  1 #CUSTOMER-ID     (N8)
  1 #NAME            (A50)
  1 #EMAIL           (A60)
END-DEFINE

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
  READ CUSTOMER CUSTOMER-ID
    MOVE CUSTOMER-ID TO #CUSTOMER-ID
  END-READ
  STOP.
END PROCEDURE.
